om2
note requires and ensures form a function's prefix; invariant forms a loop body's prefix;
note result is the returned value inside ensures
fn step x uint to uint
requires lt x 10
ensures eq result add x 1
ret add x 1
end
fn main to int
i = uint 0
while lt i 3
invariant le i 3
i = step i
end
ret int sub i 3
end
